  # B.7 Phase 4b: task-scope side-table helpers
  # =========================================================================
  # @__qz_task_scopes is a shared (mutex-protected) array of (frame, scope)
  # pairs, capacity 256 (initialized in __qz_sched_init alongside the
  # task-snapshot table). Three operations, all no-op when the mutex is 0
  # (scheduler not initialized — no `go` has been emitted, so register
  # cannot have been called):
