    # register_io_ex pathway sets BOTH a timer entry AND an iosock entry
    # for the same task; the timer-claim above won the race for the
    # timer, but the AFD poll is still running. Without an explicit
    # cancel, the AFD's eventual natural completion would re-enqueue the
    # task a SECOND time (after the timer-cancel already re-enqueued it
